 tle of Orangeburg\, the Battle of Eutaw Springs\, and the Battle of Fort W
 atson. This bus tour is part of SC American Revolution Sestercentennial Co
 mmissions Q2 meeting. It is free and open to the public\, but RSVP is requ
 ired prior to November 2. \nTour leaves from the Holiday Inn Express & Sui
 tes in Orangeburg\, SC.  The tour will end at Eutaw Springs Battlefield f
 or the Meet and Greet.  The bus will transport attendees to the hotel aft
 er the Meet & Greet (7:00PM)
