 on Day for registered students. This year the Battles of Hanging Rock and 
 as always\, the Battle of Camden will be fought. \nThere will be period me
 rchants\, demonstrators\, and military encampments on a location that puts
  you in the 18th Century. \nThere will be food truck available. \nFor tick
 eting information\, click here. \nTo register for Education Day\, click he
 re. \nTo learn more and see a detailed schedule of events\, go to our webs
 ite: Southern Campaign 1780. \nHuzzah!
