 od Auditorium\nSPONSORED BY SC250 and DUKE ENERGY FOUNDATION \nFILM SCREEN
 ING WITH PRE-SHOW LECTURE \nExperience The Patriot like never before with 
 a special pre-show lecture from lauded historians exploring the history\, 
 myths\, and realities of the American Revolution. A perfect evening for mo
 vie lovers and history enthusiasts alike. \nReservations are required as s
 pace is limited. https://artscenterkc.org/ac/the-patriot/ \nPlease be awar
 e that seating is first-come\, first-served. \nPresented through special a
 rrangement with Swank Motion Pictures\, Inc. \nThe Arts Center Revolutiona
 ry Series is made possible through grant support from the South Carolina A
 merican Revolution Sestercentennial Commission and the Duke Energy Foundat
 ion.
LOCATION:Arts Center of Kershaw County\, 810 Lyttleton St.\, Camden\, SC\,
  29020\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/fact-fiction-the-revolution-the-pat
 riot/
