BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Promise: Untold Stories of SC's Black Patriots
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T171500
UID:10003223-1794754800-1794762900@southcarolina250.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://southcarolina250.com/wp-content/uploads/2
 026/10/The-Promise-BRAC-Flyer-Final.png
CATEGORIES:Events,Performance
DESCRIPTION:Set during the Revolutionary War\, Six Black Patriots from Sou
 th Carolina are captured by British forces during the Siege of Charleston\
 ; a pivotal battle that serves as a victory for the British and Loyalist f
 orces. As the pressure of captivity intensifies\, the soldiers are left be
 hind only to realize a broader struggle that will determine their fate. Wi
 ll their promise of freedom\, liberty\, and life be in the hands of the Co
 ntinental Army\, or will the British Crown rule?
LOCATION:Broad River Arts Center\, 1500 Broad River Road\, Columbia\, SC\,
  29210\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/the-promise-untold-stories-of-scs-b
 lack-patriots/
END:VEVENT
