 2026/11/The-Untold-Heroes-of-the-Revolution-Our-Story-Too_CALENDAR.jpg
CATEGORIES:Film,Movie,Movie Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Anderson County Museum on November 17 at noon o
 r at 5:30 PM to enjoy a screening of “Our Story\, Too: Women\, Native Am
 ericans and African Americans in the Revolutionary War.” This documentar
 y uncovers the often-untold contributions of women\, Native Americans\, an
 d African Americans during the Revolutionary War\, highlighting individual
 s with South Carolina ties through expert commentary and dramatic reenactm
 ents. \nIt was produced by SCETV with production funding provided by the S
 outh Carolina American Revolution Sestercentennial Commission (SC250).
LOCATION:Anderson County Museum\, 202 East Greenville Street\, Anderson\, 
 SC\, 29621\, United States
URL:https://southcarolina250.com/event/screening-of-our-story-too-women-na
 tive-americans-and-african-americans-in-the-revolutionary-war/
